    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Group articles into a single array\nconst items = $input.all();\nconst articles = items.map(item => ({\n  id: item.json.id,\n  title: item.json.title,\n  title_en: item.json.title_en,\n  summary_en: item.json.summary_en,\n  content_en: item.json.content_en,\n  slug: item.json.slug,\n  category: item.json.category,\n  source_url: item.json.source_url,\n  created_at: item.json.created_at\n}));\n\nreturn {\n  articles: articles,\n  articleCount: articles.length,\n  todayDate: $('Parse Trigger Type').item.json.todayDate\n};"
      },
      "id": "5e29e461-df2f-44e1-995b-56e16e2ccf69",
      "name": "Prepare Articles for AI",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -1568,
        368
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Format articles for OpenAI prompt"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4.1-MINI"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a LinkedIn Growth Editor crafting high-engagement tech news posts in ENGLISH.\n\nOBJECTIVE\nMaximize reach (dwell time, comments, saves, shares).\nUse UNICODE BOLD (Mathematical Bold) for the main headline and up to TWO short key phrases per item. Do NOT use markdown **bold**.\n\nCONFIG\n- MAX_ITEMS: 5–8\n- MAX_CHARS_TOTAL: 2800\n- LINK_BASE: https://cemkoyluoglu.codes/tech-news/\n\nSELECTION RULES\n- Choose the MOST INTERESTING 5–8 items (novelty, real-world impact, trend momentum, surprise).\n- Ensure topical diversity (AI, data, cybersecurity, cloud, hardware, policy, etc.).\n- Avoid duplicates and trivial incremental updates.\n\nWRITING RULES\n- Tone: smart, concise, conversational (no hype, no corp-jargon).\n- First line = HOOK (10–18 words) in UNICODE BOLD.\n- Each item: different emoji + 1–2 sentence summary + one-line \"why it matters\".\n- In each item, convert ≤2 short key phrases to UNICODE BOLD (e.g., model/product/law).\n- Vary sentence openings; no repeated emojis.\n- Keep total length under MAX_CHARS_TOTAL.\n\nHASHTAGS (no branded tags)\n- Generate 3–6 from this curated set (no duplicates): \n  #TechNews #AI #ArtificialIntelligence #GenerativeAI #MachineLearning #ML\n  #DataScience #MLOps #Cybersecurity #InfoSec #CloudComputing #EdgeComputing\n  #Semiconductors #ChipDesign #GPUs #OpenSource #Startup #Innovation\n  #AIResearch #NLP #ComputerVision #Privacy #AIRegulation #TechPolicy\n- Prefer 1–2 broad + 2–3 niche based on selected items.\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT (single post; links stay inside the post)\n𝐓𝐨𝐝𝐚𝐲'𝐬 𝐓𝐨𝐩 𝐓𝐞𝐜𝐡 𝐇𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐥𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭𝐬: [HOOK line in Unicode bold]\n(if you want to make it bold not use ** , use unicode bold)\n\n[EMOJI] [1–2 sentence summary + why it matters; include up to 2 Unicode-bold phrases]\n🔗 LINK_BASE[slug]\n\n(Repeat for all selected)\n\n[Hashtags line: 3–6 from the curated set]\n\nARTICLES JSON:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.articles, null, 2) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "maxTokens": 2000,
          "temperature": 0.7
        }
      },
